<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia prices steady in quiet trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia prices steady in quiet trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash ammonia and diammonium phosphate (DAP) prices were unchanged in very quiet dealings Wednesday, cash sources said.</p>
<p>&quot;It's as quiet as can be,&quot; a dealer said.</p>
<p>Expectations for a jump in soybean acreage was dampening interest from fertilizer dealers, cash sources said.</p>
<p>			  Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Monday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	  174-176		     unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf    185-187		     unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		197		     unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
